        "label": "Kitchen remodel from TaskNotes",
        "body": "# Kitchen remodel, from your tasks\n\nThe Cube Input stands in for a live TaskNotes feed (swap in the TaskNotes node beside it). Filter keeps the tasks whose projects contain \"Kitchen remodel\". Computed Column turns each task's timeEstimate into a Duration in days. Schedule works out Start, Finish, and the critical path, and the Gantt draws it.\n\nReading TaskNotes live needs the desktop app and its local API; the snapshot computes anywhere.",
        "color": "violet",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 210
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tasks",
      "type": "CubeInputNode",
      "x": -38,
      "y": 474,
      "init": {
